  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_friend_01",
      "hash64": "0B6F503EBE96FC38",
      "text": "Oye, Mencía, nunca nos has hablado de tus\\npadres. ¿Cómo son?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_01",
      "hash64": "2F943421E23CA2E4",
      "text": "¿Mis padres? Pues no sé, normales, supongo.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_01",
      "hash64": "ECC8A4A044460EC2",
      "text": "¿Pero qué dices? Si hasta yo sé que tu padre es\\nun alto ejecutivo en la empresa del SmartRotom.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_02",
      "hash64": "2F943721E23CA7FD",
      "text": "¡¿Cómo sabes eso?![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_02",
      "hash64": "ECC8A3A044460D0F",
      "text": "Porque es famoso, lo conoce todo el mundo.\\nY porque investigué un poco por mi cuenta.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_friend_02",
      "hash64": "0B6F533EBE970151",
      "text": "Vamos, que te habrás criado entre algodones.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_03",
      "hash64": "2F943621E23CA64A",
      "text": "¿Qué? ¡No, quita, quita! Yo no pertenezco a ese\\nmundo.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_04",
      "hash64": "2F943121E23C9DCB",
      "text": "Es que...[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_05",
      "hash64": "2F943021E23C9C18",
      "text": "Padre y madre nunca han estado muy encima de\\nmí. Pero en el buen sentido, ¿eh?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_06",
      "hash64": "2F943321E23CA131",
      "text": "Y como, además, tengo una hermana mayor,\\nsiempre me han dejado ir a mi bola.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_friend_03",
      "hash64": "0B6F523EBE96FF9E",
      "text": "¡¿\"Padre\"?! ¡¿\"Madre\"?![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_03",
      "hash64": "ECC8A2A044460B5C",
      "text": "Las cosas de la burguesía.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_07",
      "hash64": "2F943221E23C9F7E",
      "text": "¡Jo, Noa, cómo te pasas! Seguro que en tu\\nfamilia también cuecen habas.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_04",
      "hash64": "ECC8A1A0444609A9",
      "text": "Mi... Mi familia, pues...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_05",
      "hash64": "ECC8A0A0444607F6",
      "text": "Me pone de los nervios.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_08",
      "hash64": "2F942D21E23C96FF",
      "text": "¿Quieres decir que son muy sobreprotectores?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_06",
      "hash64": "ECC89FA044460643",
      "text": "Mi padre, siempre superanimado dando besos\\ny abrazos, y me llama \"Noíta\", ¡cosa que odio![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_07",
      "hash64": "ECC89EA044460490",
      "text": "Es que no me deja en paz, ¡qué pesadilla![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_friend_04",
      "hash64": "0B6F553EBE9704B7",
      "text": "Ya ves, qué duro eso de tener un padre que te\\nquiere tanto, ¿eh? Lo siento por ti, Noíta.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_08",
      "hash64": "ECC8ADA044461E0D",
      "text": "Vaciles los justos, ¿eh?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_09",
      "hash64": "2F942C21E23C954C",
      "text": "Eeeh... Pueees... La madre de [VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\nparece supermaja.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_friend_05",
      "hash64": "0B6F543EBE970304",
      "text": "¿La conoces?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_10",
      "hash64": "2F912F21E23A648E",
      "text": "¡Sí! ¡Le preparó un bocadillo con una pinta\\nestupenda![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_friend_06",
      "hash64": "0B6F573EBE97081D",
      "text": "Jo, pues qué suerte. Me comía ahora uno bien\\na gusto.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
